      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Ah! So the suspicion is cleared up! Then Vingan belongs to an ordinary family?.. He is not a son of a great household? Amma! Are you really telling the truth?",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
